.com/photos/6238100/pexels-photo-6238100.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350\";s:11:\"description\";s:100:\"Adult woman shopping online using a tablet while holding a credit card, sitting comfortably indoors.\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:32:\"https://www.pexels.com/@thirdman\";s:11:\"author_name\";s:8:\"Thirdman\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:8:\"portrait\";s:6:\"engine\";s:6:\"pexels\";s:10:\"engine_url\";s:18:\"https://pexels.com\";s:4:\"slug\";s:29:\"woman-online-shopping-6238100\";s:17:\"download_location\";s:0:\"\";}i:10;a:11:{s:2:\"id\";s:7:\"6331230\";s:3:\"url\";s:72:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6331230/pexels-photo-6331230.jpeg?w=700\";s:13:\"optimized_url\";s:98:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6331230/pexels-photo-6331230.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350\";s:11:\"description\";s:108:\"High angle of unrecognizable woman sitting on chair and choosing clothes in internet shop using mobile phone\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:36:\"https://www.pexels.com/@anete-lusina\";s:11:\"author_name\";s:12:\"Anete Lusina\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:8:\"portrait\";s:6:\"engine\";s:6:\"pexels\";s:10:\"engine_url\";s:18:\"https://pexels.com\";s:4:\"slug\";s:50:\"woman-using-smartphone-for-online-shopping-6331230\";s:17:\"download_location\";s:0:\"\";}i:11;a:11:{s:2:\"id\";s:8:\"33516105\";s:3:\"url\";s:74:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/33516105/pexels-photo-33516105.jpeg?w=700\";s:13:\"optimized_url\";s:100:\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/33516105/pexels-photo-33516105.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=350\";s:11:\"description\";s:76:\"Close-up of sunglasses hanging on a paper shopping bag against a white wall.\";s:10:\"author_url\";s:45:\"https://www.pexels.com/@elena_-sher-944248089\";s:11:\"author_name\";s:11:\"elena_ sher\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:8:\"portrait\";s:6:\"engine\";s:6:\"pexels\";s:10:\"engine_url\";s:18:\"https://pexels.com\";s:4:\"slug\";s:53:\"stylish-sunglasses-hanging-on-a-shopping-bag-33516105\";s:17:\"download_location\";s:0:\"\";}i:12;a:11:{s:2:\"id\";s